Types of method :

Based on static keyword method are 2 types .
(1)static method
(2)non static method

inside class static method call static variable and static method 
(1)directly.(better)
(2)by classname
(3)by object refeernce
(4)by object

class Test
{
    static void show()
    {
    	System.out.println("show method");
    }
	public static void main(String arg[])
	{
	     show();//directly
	     Test.show();//by classname
	     Test t=null;
         t.show();//by object reference
	     new Test().show(); //by object
	}

}

